      "routeLabel": "Filosofie Algemeen; 2026 entrants; Dutch-language bachelor",
      "limitation": "The pathway includes 30 EC of genuine choice space and a required 10-EC thesis. First-year mentoring carries 1 EC; second-year mentoring carries 0 EC. The Entrepreneurship track is a different route and is not combined with this pathway."
    },
